---
description: >-
  `style`, `class` and `:::` before the node they name (v12 loses them, D433
  warns), `classDef default` before and after a node, and `style a,b` stopping
  at its first unknown id.
---
requirementDiagram
  style early_req fill:#f9f
  class early_req important
  early_req:::important

  classDef default fill:#eef
  classDef important stroke:#f00,stroke-width:3px

  requirement early_req {
    id: 1
    text: styled too early
  }

  element late_el {
    type: simulation
  }

  classDef default stroke-dasharray: 5 5
  style ghost,late_el fill:#ccf
  style early_req,late_el color:#333
  class late_el important
